# Topic ACL of the Witness / aeriOS broker (users from secrets/mosquitto/passwd).
# Nothing is granted to anonymous clients; allow_anonymous is off as well.

# witness-relay (the Messages API): publishes every submission record.
user relay
topic write aerios/iota/submissions/#

# witness-indexer: consumes the submission records, publishes incident alerts.
user indexer
topic read aerios/iota/submissions/#
topic write witness/alerts/#

# Read-only account for people and dashboards (mosquitto_sub -u observer ...).
user observer
topic read aerios/iota/submissions/#
topic read witness/alerts/#
